  "description": "This 15x6.00-6 lawn mower tire kit (includes 2 tires, rims, and inner tubes) features 4-ply natural rubber and a turf-friendly tread, with a 570 lbs load capacity. Pre-mounted and ready to install, it fits most lawn mowers (please check your mower's specifications before ordering).\nFeatures\nCOMPATIBILITY & SPECIFICATIONS: This lawn mower tires kit fits most mowers with size 15x6.00-6 (approx. 14.2\" outer diameter, 5.3\" wide). Features a 3\" centered hub & 3/4\" bearings, 6\" rim diameter. Max load: 570 lbs; max inflation: 30 PSI. Please check your mower's specs before ordering to ensure a proper fit. (Not for highway use.)\nTURF-FRIENDLY & HIGH-PERFORMANCE TREAD: The unique tread pattern boosts traction while minimizing lawn damage. The wide, flat footprint spreads pressure evenly, reduces noise, improves heat dissipation and water drainage, and gives you better handling, smoother ride, and quieter operation.\nUPGRADED 4-PLY TIRE: Made from quality natural rubber, these 4‑ply pneumatic 15x6.00-6 lawnmower tires deliver high load capacity and durability. You get dependable traction and smooth rolling, whether you're mowing a small yard or handling large acreage – stable, reliable performance every time.\nCOMPLETE TIRE KIT – READY TO INSTALL: No need to hunt down separate tires, wheels, or tubes. These lawn tractor tires come pre‑mounted on rims with bushings already installed. Just remove your old tires and bolt these on. Saves you time and hassle – no extra parts or assembly required.\nPLEASE NOTE: This kit includes 2PCS 15x6-6 tires with tubes for riding lawn mowers. Not for highway use. Double‑check your mower's tire size and rim dimensions against our specs before buying to ensure a proper fit.",
